# Every package in this registry, one name per line.
#
# `veyl get officials` installs all of them. `--nodlls` leaves out the
# ones carrying a native library, which are the large ones; whether a
# package is native is read from its own veyl.pkg rather than marked
# here, so this list cannot drift out of step with reality.
dotenv
gl
ini
jwt
querybuilder
sqlite
toml
totp
validator
